`,jsxRuntimeExports.jsx(Ct.p,{children:"Think of it this way: if you were trying to predict next month's malaria cases, you wouldn't just look at last month's case count. You'd also consider the recent rainfall, the temperature, the time of year, and maybe the population size. Each of those additional pieces of information is a covariate."}),`
